{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>47歲TVB主持陸浩明日前宣佈結束與38歲圈外女友陳詩欣長達14年愛情長跑，正式在馬爾代夫求婚成功。這段歷經多年的感情終於迎來開花結果，女方隨即被起底發現不僅擁有超模身材更具備驚人高學歷。這位獲封為翻版張曼玉背後隱藏超狂背景瞬間成為全城焦點。</p><p>陸浩明馬爾代夫沙灘求婚浪漫畫面全公開</p><p>日前陸浩明趁著與陳詩欣前往度假勝地馬爾代夫旅遊時，在水清沙幼海灘上精心策劃一場浪漫求婚儀式。相片可見他準備了巨型鑽戒以及精緻沙灘晚餐，並在浪漫氣氛下正式單膝下跪，為這段長達14年愛情長跑畫上完美句號。兩人更拍下多張甜蜜合照放閃，女方手戴閃爆鑽戒難掩喜悅之情。</p><p>陸浩明社交平台發佈長文承諾愛護未婚妻</p><p>求婚成功後陸浩明火速在個人社交平台公開喜訊，高調上載多張求婚現場相片與大眾分享喜悅。他親自發文向相伴多年的未婚妻許下承諾，寫道「我會用10,000倍嘅努力，讓妳幸福快樂」。他過往曾公開表示一直拼搏工作儲老婆本，務求為另一半打造優質生活，如今終於有足夠能力迎娶女方過門。</p><p>肥媽展開了「靈魂拷問」與嘲笑</p><p>肥媽得知陸浩明（6號）在馬爾代夫求婚成功後，高興得不得了，但隨即發揮一貫的搞笑幽默作風，對 6 號展開了「靈魂拷問」與嘲笑： 「點解唔早啲求婚？你揀金價最貴時結婚！」，肥媽笑稱 6 號太遲採取行動，偏偏挑選了黃金價格處於歷史高位的時候才宣布結婚。過去肥媽曾開玩笑承諾，等 6 號結婚時會大方送他一個「足金農場」當作賀禮。這次 6 號公開被嘲笑後也幽默回應，笑指這杯「新抱茶」絕對少不了肥媽，而且如果契媽肯在婚禮上為他們「唱一首歌」，他就已經心滿意足了。肥媽其實一早已經把陳詩欣（Ayan）當作自己的「新抱仔」看待，雖然口頭上開玩笑心疼金價，但內心對這對結束 14 年愛情長跑的準新人感到非常欣慰與幸福！</p><p>翻版張曼玉陳詩欣超狂學歷與背景惹熱議</p><p>現年38歲陳詩欣不僅擁有1米73高挑模特兒身段，更是一名擁有香港理工大學時裝設計碩士學位高材生，憑藉出眾氣質獲外界封為翻版張曼玉。她除了外表亮眼，更曾獲陸浩明豪花100,000元學費資助前往法國修讀藍帶廚藝課程。回顧兩人情史，陸浩明早前在旅遊節目《Grand住去大阪》中曾遭嘉賓C君直斥「拖咗人咁多年唔肯娶人呢」，連汪明荃亦曾在節目《1+1幸福》公開催婚。</p><p>網民激讚陳詩欣美貌與智慧並重送上祝福</p><p>喜訊曝光後大批圈中好友與網民紛紛湧入社交平台留言祝賀，熱烈討論這位隱藏版超高質未婚妻。不少網民驚嘆陳詩欣保養得宜且背景強大，紛紛留言大讚「老婆好靚女」以及「真正美貌與智慧並重」。同時亦有大批粉絲對於兩人終於修成正果感到欣慰，留言表示「等咗14年終於結」及「快啲生返個得意BB」，整個社交平台被海量祝福語句洗版。</p><figure><img alt=\"陸浩明 （圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lukhoo_1787893192_3973455676189246316_708533_5618628396a912fa5d41d7-1024x1365.jpg\"/><figcaption>陸浩明 （圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陸浩明 （圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lukhoo_1787893192_3973455812403545698_708533_20606379526a912f92f1411-1024x1365.jpg\"/><figcaption>陸浩明 （圖片來源：IG@lukhoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陸浩明 c君 2015年，肥媽同陸浩明正式上契。（圖片來源：陸浩明@Facebook）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823455144786584_4946427596a964b381373d.jpg\"/><figcaption>陸浩明 c君 2015年，肥媽同陸浩明正式上契。（圖片來源：陸浩明@Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陸浩明 c君 陳詩欣大曬S型身材（圖片來源：IG@ayanbubi）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823455286696719_882000976a964b3930d1e.jpg\"/><figcaption>陸浩明 c君 陳詩欣大曬S型身材（圖片來源：IG@ayanbubi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"6102540751548912137.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823455388134664_17673559396a964b3a3d754.jpg\"/><figcaption>6102540751548912137.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"6102540751548912138.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823455507158704_6515428536a964b3b7ef75.jpg\"/><figcaption>6102540751548912138.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156831166103_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823455634046756_20779596996a964b3cb1fc5.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156831166103_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156772562092_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823455788052872_9825285776a964b3e711c4.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156772562092_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1685441989_3114035569821711533_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823456028035787_16995376306a964b41944b9.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1685441989_3114035569821711533_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1632795600_2672405647469299983_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823456351834753_9563938376a964b43e5297.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1632795600_2672405647469299983_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1685441989_3114035569830002522_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823456555665542_873240486a964b4611172.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1685441989_3114035569830002522_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1696426859_3206183339717743499_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823456724532777_20353050336a964b47cba12.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1696426859_3206183339717743499_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1696426859_3206183339726095951_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823457201863678_5593629096a964b4c8e68c.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1696426859_3206183339726095951_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1696426859_3206183339726143549_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823457401779054_8606922246a964b4e51c66.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1696426859_3206183339726143549_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1726405108_3457659114015915245_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823457628028356_14360635346a964b50bf965.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1726405108_3457659114015915245_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1729344091_3482313091009277244_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823457836155536_19698200226a964b52e1858.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1729344091_3482313091009277244_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1729344091_3482313091328134826_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823458019544894_20558252186a964b5492d42.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1729344091_3482313091328134826_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1729344091_3482313091026022788_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823458207841686_16831563256a964b568b3a3.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1729344091_3482313091026022788_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1726405108_3457659113864945790_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823458462514169_898896616a964b58ee7c4.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1726405108_3457659113864945790_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1726405108_3457659113847928161_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823458616136573_18170876636a964b5aa4bf9.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1726405108_3457659113847928161_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1726405108_3457659113982191796_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823458858561112_10857362596a964b5d00f07.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1726405108_3457659113982191796_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1729513516_3483734334002023742_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823459040564932_10928933406a964b5ebc5fb.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1729513516_3483734334002023742_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1729775361_3485930844911561676_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823459201119006_9349231876a964b604fc16.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1729775361_3485930844911561676_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1746438005_3625707237311639129_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823459364693905_385571646a964b61f3b4b.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1746438005_3625707237311639129_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1746438005_3625707237328292564_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823459485882778_18506692536a964b634bd04.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1746438005_3625707237328292564_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ayanbubi_1746438005_3625707237168961496_1047905.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823459645442262_16327856296a964b6503170.jpg\"/><figcaption>ayanbubi_1746438005_3625707237168961496_1047905.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"lukhoo_1756043331_3706282551055502271_708533.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823459795853396_14721095966a964b66949ef.jpg\"/><figcaption>lukhoo_1756043331_3706282551055502271_708533.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T03:59:50.794071+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2678,"images":27,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}